<https://example.org/dmo/id/contraindication/elderly-with-comorbidities> a dmo:Contraindication ;
    rdfs:label "Elderly with Comorbidities" ;
    dmo:contraCode "elderly-with-comorbidities" ;
    dmo:rationale "In these situations, admission to a Level 2/HDU facility should be considered. Fluids should be replaced cautiously, and if appropriate, guided by the central venous pressure measurements." ;
    dmo:severity "Relative" ;
    dmo:triggerCriteria "Seek medical clarification if the individual is a young adult, elderly, pregnant or has other serious co-morbidities including heart and renal failure." ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "Seek medical clarification if the individual is a young adult, elderly, pregnant or has other serious co-morbidities including heart and renal failure. In these situations, admission to a Level 2/HDU facility should be considered. Fluids should be replaced cautiously, and if appropriate, guided by the central venous pressure measurements." ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://example.org/dmo/id/guidelineSource/jbds_02_nursing_management_for_dka_v1_20122022> .

